Package: Puddin
Type: Package
Title: Gravitational-wave Binary Parameter Conversions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("The Puddin Authors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "puddin@example.com"))
Description: R interface to the Puddin library, providing fast and accurate
    parameter transformations for compact binary systems in gravitational-wave
    astronomy.  Wraps a Rust core via a C ABI; the computational routines
    enforce dimensional correctness at compile time using the Rust 'uom' crate.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
